=2 Walkthrough
* Talk to the {p:Moogle (A)} at (F-7) Conflux #7. He will ask you to find him materials.
* Retrieve a {@k} {k:Piece of sodden oak lumber} from the **Lumber Chest** at Conflux #1 near the maw.
* Return to the {p:Moogle (A)}, who takes the log then asks for a {@k} {k:Sodden linen cloth}.
* You can find one in the **Fabric Chest** at Conflux #6.
* After you turn that into him, the final item he needs is a {@k} {k:Dhorme khimaira's mane}.
** You must defeat {m:Dhorme Khimaira} to obtain this. It will drop to everyone who has this quest active.
